                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The graphics and atmosphere are good. Also the combat was really fun, but I will not recommend for the following reasons. Key binding works in one room then you enter the next and it is back to the default so you never know what the controls are going to be. There are two keybinding menus, one on the main menu screen and the other on the in gameplay menu. You can change keybindings in both, but they don't match each other afterwards so it seems they are causing a conflict in loading the controls. The language reading parts are not always in English, some times it shows up in Chinese. This could be a really great game with some more updates.",
